# This template provides comprehensive ignore rules for all project types.
# Review and uncomment patterns specific to your project.
#
# Key principles:
# 1. Never commit secrets, keys, or credentials
# 2. Never commit dependencies (node_modules, venv, etc.)
# 3. Never commit caches (.pytest_cache, .mypy_cache, etc.)
# 4. Never commit build output (dist, build, out, etc.)
# 5. Never commit test output and coverage reports
# 6. Never commit clutter (root-level images, temp files, etc.)
#
# When in doubt, add it to .gitignore rather than committing it.
